--- !u!114 &2044427540
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2044427539}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 445e13603f407004589a4378f99edb2c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DersNotu
  dersBasligi: "Mod\xFCl 3 | Ders 8 | Matrislere Giri\u015F"
  amac: "Bu sahne dersin ba\u015F\u0131ndaki durumdur. Kup orijindedir ve matrisi
    birim matristir. MatrisKupu kapal\u0131d\u0131r, dersin ikinci b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCnde
    siz a\xE7acaks\u0131n\u0131z.\n\n\xD6nce bir k\xFCp\xFCn Transform de\u011Ferlerini
    de\u011Fi\u015Ftirip d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCm matrisinin hangi say\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131n
    de\u011Fi\u015Fti\u011Fini izliyoruz. Sonra tersini yap\u0131yor, matrisin say\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131
    elle yazarak bir birim k\xFCp\xFC \xF6l\xE7ekliyor, ta\u015F\u0131yor, d\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCyor
    ve e\u011Fiyoruz."
  adimlar:
  - "Ders08_Baslangic sahnesini a\xE7\u0131n ve Hierarchy'de Kup nesnesini se\xE7in.
    K\xFCp\xFCn \xFCzerindeki d\xF6rt sat\u0131r, nesnenin matrisidir. Ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7ta
    birim matris g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr."
  - "Kup nesnesinin Position de\u011Ferini 3, 1, 2 yap\u0131n. Matrisin yaln\u0131zca
    son s\xFCtunu de\u011Fi\u015Fir."
  - "Scale de\u011Ferini 2, 1, 1 yap\u0131n. Birinci s\xFCtunun ilk say\u0131s\u0131
    2 olur ve k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 ok uzar. Scale de\u011Ferini yeniden 1, 1, 1
    yap\u0131n."
  - "Rotation Y de\u011Ferini 90 yap\u0131n. Birinci s\xFCtun 0, 0, -1 ve \xFC\xE7\xFCnc\xFC
    s\xFCtun 1, 0, 0 olur. K\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 ve mavi oklar\u0131n yeni y\xF6nlerini
    s\xFCtunlarla kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n."
  - "Kup nesnesini se\xE7ip Inspector'\u0131n en \xFCst\xFCndeki kutunun i\u015Faretini
    kald\u0131rarak kapat\u0131n. MatrisKupu nesnesini a\xE7\u0131n. Inspector'da
    d\xF6rt sat\u0131rl\u0131k birim matris, sahnede \xFCst \xFCste duran gri ve
    sar\u0131 k\xFCp g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr."
  - "Satir 0 alan\u0131n\u0131n X de\u011Ferini 2 yap\u0131n. Sar\u0131 k\xFCp X
    ekseninde uzar. Ard\u0131ndan Satir 0, Satir 1 ve Satir 2 alanlar\u0131n\u0131n
    W de\u011Ferlerini s\u0131ras\u0131yla 3, 1 ve 2 yap\u0131n. K\xFCp ta\u015F\u0131n\u0131r."
  - "Satir 0 de\u011Ferini 0, 0, 1, 3 ve Satir 2 de\u011Ferini -1, 0, 0, 2 yap\u0131n.
    Sar\u0131 k\xFCp Y ekseni etraf\u0131nda 90 derece d\xF6ner."
  - "Satir 0 de\u011Ferini 1, 0.5, 0, 0 ve Satir 2 de\u011Ferini 0, 0, 1, 0 yap\u0131n.
    Satir 1 alan\u0131n\u0131n W de\u011Ferini 0 yap\u0131n. K\xFCp yana do\u011Fru
    e\u011Filir."
  kendinDene:
  - "MatrisKupu nesnesinde k\xF6\u015Fegendeki \xFC\xE7 say\u0131y\u0131 0.5 yap\u0131n.
    K\xFCp nas\u0131l de\u011Fi\u015Fiyor?"
  - "Satir 0 alan\u0131n\u0131n X de\u011Ferini -1 yap\u0131n. K\xFCp hangi d\xFCzleme
    g\xF6re ayna g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFCs\xFCne d\xF6n\xFCyor?"
  - "Satir 0 de\u011Ferini 0, 0, 0, 0 yap\u0131n. K\xFCp neye d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCyor?
    Neden?"
  - "Kup nesnesini a\xE7\u0131n ve Rotation Y de\u011Ferini 45 yap\u0131n. Birinci
    s\xFCtundaki say\u0131lar\u0131 alt\u0131nc\u0131 dersteki kosin\xFCs ve sin\xFCs
    de\u011Ferleriyle kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n."
